<p dir="auto">Add a note to the Firefox compatibility data for <code class="notranslate">URLPattern</code> documenting that lookahead and lookbehind assertions were not supported before Firefox 149.</p>
<p dir="auto">The <code class="notranslate">URLPattern</code> API itself remains supported from Firefox 142; this change documents the historical limitation in its regular expression support rather than changing the API's <code class="notranslate">version_added</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto">Additional details:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1998871" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1998871</a></li>
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1984171" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1984171</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Bug 1998871 documents the <code class="notranslate">URLPattern</code> lookahead failure in Firefox 146 and records the fix in Firefox 149.</p>
