        <title type="html"><![CDATA[[Google Privacy Sandbox] Chrome 152 removed Shared Storage API]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30659</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30659"/>
        <updated>2026-10-01T10:00:18.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45960703?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Google Chrome 152 removed internal implementation of Shared Storage API and turned all JS methods into stubs.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">Starting with 152, every call to Shared Storage fails, even if JS API is exposed (which is configurable by Google's experimrnt system). On most instals of Google Chrome, Google remotely removed even the stub API. Please see <a href="https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/uh5Ke6qyegc/m/86-1s-cTAAAJ" rel="nofollow">"Intent To Deprecate and Remove: Shared Storage API"</a>.</p>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto">This PR is tangentially related to <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5161427314" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30242" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30242/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30242">#30242</a>.</p>

]]></content>
